### NainDrive (Autoescuela) - REST API Requests
@host = http://localhost:8000
@api = {{host}}/api/v1

### 1. Health Check
GET {{host}}/health HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### 2. Dashboard KPIs
GET {{api}}/dashboard/kpis HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### 3. List Students
GET {{api}}/students HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### 4. Create Student
POST {{api}}/students HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Carlos Gomez",
  "document_id": "12345678Z",
  "package_type": "B",
  "practical_classes": 10,
  "advance_payment_cents": 15000
}

### 5. Calculate and Generate Student Invoice PDF
POST {{api}}/students/1/invoice HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/pdf
